    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d465">

                <pb facs="0622" n="611" xml:id="pg611"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123En3/560: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Iran</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Engert</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-09-04T15:00:00-04:00">September 4, 1937—3
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>43. Personal for Engert from Murray. Your 76, September 3, 10 a.m.<anchor n="18"
                        xml:id="d465-f1"/> Since Consul General White<anchor n="19" xml:id="d465-f2"
                    /> has only just completed his annual visit to Kabul no further visit from an
                    American official would seem advisable at this moment.</p>
                <p>You might inform the Afghan Foreign Minister that in view of the fact that you
                    have taken charge such a short time ago in Teheran and are carrying on at the
                    Legation more or less alone it would not be practicable for you to be absent at
                    this time.</p>
                <p>You may at the same time inform him in confidence that the Department has under
                    consideration the advisability of my visiting Afghanistan during a possible tour
                    of my area which, however, in all probability could not take place before early
                    next year. It would be my intention to visit Teheran at the same time. In case
                    it is not possible for me to make the visit to Kabul it is hoped that by that
                    time you will be able to go. It is furthermore possible that the Department
                    might desire us to proceed there together in connection with certain important
                    matters that must be discussed. [Murray.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
